title: Game Over.
new-page: true
go-to: eg_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.game_over = 1;
// Achievements:
// Große Koalition - form a grand coalition
// Krasnoye Znamya - Form the Red Banner.
this.achieve('game_completed');

// Nepotism - At the end of the game, Rafail Abramovitch is Government Chairman and his son is a Party Advisor.
if (Q.rein_advisor == 1 && Q.chancellor == 'abramovich') {
    this.achieve('nepotism');
}
// Grazhdanskaya voyna v Rossii - enter a long civil war.
if (Q.long_war) {
    this.achieve('civil_war');
}
// Nepobedimaya Respublika - The Democratic Federative Republic has survived.
if (Q.republic_victory) {
    this.achieve('victory_for_the_republic');
}
// Yedinaya - survive on easy without a civil war.
// Yedinaya i Nedelimaya Rossiya - survive on medium without a civil war.
// Sim pobedishi - survive on hard without a civil war.

// Rossiya budet svobodnoy - form a united front with the RKP, and win the civil war.

// Narodnyy front - form a popular front government, and win the civil war.

// Verfassungskoalition - form a Constitutional Coalition.
// Ekonomicheskaya politika - enact an economic plan.
// Chudo ekonomika - reduce unemployment below 10% and have a non-negative budget by 1933.
if (Q.year >= 1932  && Q.unemployed < 8.6 && Q.budget > 0 && Q.inflation < 5) {
    this.achieve('wirtschaftswunder');
}
// Bollwerk der Demokratie - resist the Prussian Coup, and win.
if (Q.republic_victory && Q.resist_coup) {
    this.achieve('bollwerk_der_demokratie');
}
// Kátorga - Arrest Leuchtenberg
// Massovaya politika - form a people's party
// Sotsial'no progressivnyy - Legalize homosexuality and recognize trans rights.
if (Q.homosexual_rights >= 2) {
    this.achieve('hirschfeld');
}
// Zhenskiye batal'ony - Allow women into the military and the Soyuz Fevralya.
// Zhenotdel - Support and enact reforms for women's rights.
if ((Q.womens_work && Q.womens_rights >= 5) || (Q.abortion_rights && Q.womens_rights >= 3)) {
    this.achieve('equality');
}

// Marionetka - elect Mikhail Kalinin as president or government chairman.
if (Q.chancellor == "Kalinin" || Q.president == "Kalinin") {
    this.achieve('sohn_seiner_klasse');
}

// calculate normalized class voting for the achievements
for (var c of Q.classes) {
    var class_votes = 0;
    for (var party of Q.parties) {
        if (Q[c+'_'+party] < 0) {
            Q[c+'_'+party] = 0;
        }
        class_votes += Q[c+'_'+party];
    }
    for (var party of Q.parties) {
        Q[c + '_' + party + '_normalized'] = Math.round(100*Q[c+'_'+party]/class_votes);
    }
}

// Mezhdunarodnyy den' trudyashchikhsya - join the RKP in the May Day march.
// Partiya vlasti - form an RSDRP majority government in the Reichstag.
// Rabochiye i sluzhashchiye - have over 50% of New Middle Class support.
if (Q.new_middle_rsdrp_normalized && Q.new_middle_rsdrp_normalized >= 50) {
    this.achieve('panik_im_mittelstand');
}
// Marksizm-narodizm - have over 50% rural support.
if (Q.rural_rsdrp_normalized && Q.rural_rsdrp_normalized >= 50) {
    this.achieve('bauernrevolution');
}
if (Q.catholics_rsdrp_normalized && Q.catholics_rsdrp_normalized >= 50) {
    this.achieve('katholischer_sozialismus');
}
if (Q.workers_rsdrp_normalized >= 80 && Q.new_middle_rsdrp_normalized <= 20 && Q.old_middle_rsdrp_normalized <= 20 && Q.rural_rsdrp_normalized <= 20) {
    this.achieve('klassenkampf');
}
if (Q.workers_rsdrp_normalized >= 40 && Q.new_middle_rsdrp_normalized >= 40 && Q.old_middle_rsdrp_normalized >= 40 && Q.rural_rsdrp_normalized >= 40) {
    this.achieve('grosse_volkspartei');
}
// Sovetskaya respublika - begin the transformation to a socialist economy.
if (Q.rsdrp_in_government && ((Q.nationalization_progress >= 2 && Q.economic_democracy >= 3) || (Q.nationalization_progress >= 1 && Q.economic_democracy >= 4))) {
    this.achieve('raterepublik');
}
// Epokha krizisa - survive both a fascist coup and a capital strike.
if (Q.march_on_berlin_seen && Q.capital_strike_seen && Q.chancellor != "Leuchtenberg" && Q.president != "Leuchtenberg" && !Q.total_defeat) {
    this.achieve("polykrise");
}
// Velikiy perelom - implement two different economic plans.
if ((Q.nationalization_progress >= 1 && Q.wtb_implemented >= 1) || (Q.wtb_implemented >= 1 && Q.moderate_plan_progress >= 1) || (Q.nationalization_progress >= 1 && Q.moderate_plan_progress >= 1)) {
    this.achieve("wirtschaftsexperiment");
}
// Avtonomnyye sovety - support factory takeovers by workers.
if (Q.factory_takeovers >= 2) {
    this.achieve("syndikalismus");
}
// Bol'shoy terror - lose the civil war against Leuchtenberg.
if ((Q.chancellor_party == "NTS" || Q.chancellor == "Leuchtenberg" || Q.president == "Leuchtenberg") && Q.total_defeat) {
    this.achieve('stolperstein');
}
// party program wip name - fulfill the goals of the party programme - increase welfare, reform justice, support women's rights, progressive taxation, works councils, build a European Union.
if ((Q.welfare > 0 && Q.judicial_reform >= 2 && Q.womens_work >= 1 && Q.family_law >= 1 && Q.upper_tax_rates > Q.lower_tax_rates && Q.works_councils > 0 && Q.eu > 0)) {
    this.achieve('heidelberger_programm');
}
!}

= End


@eg_menu

- #endings
- @end_game: End game.


@leuchtenberg_wins
view-if: (chancellor == "Leuchtenberg" or president == "Leuchtenberg") and (total_defeat==1 or civil_war_seen == 0)
title: Sergey Leuchtenberg is in undisputed control over Germany.
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Sergey Leuchtenberg is in undisputed control over Russia. The Mensheviks, along with all of the democratic forces, have failed.

[? if civil_war_seen == 1 : At the very least, we fought back. Perhaps our resistance will be celebrated in the future, even if we are not around to witness it. ?]

@war_against_leuchtenberg
view-if: (chancellor == "Leuchtenberg" or president == "Leuchtenberg") and (long_war == 1)
title: Sergey Leuchtenberg is in power, but we are fighting to stop him.
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Sergey Leuchtenberg has taken power in Russia. However, we have rallied the democratic forces of the country against him, and are fighting back. The outcome of this war is uncertain.


@no_leuchtenberg
view-if: chancellor != "Leuchtenberg" and president != "Leuchtenberg" and president != "Göring" and chancellor_party != "NTS"
title: Leuchtenberg does not yet control Germany...
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Leuchtenberg does not yet control Russia. [? if chancellor == "Balashev" : However, Chairman Balashev's authoritarianism and nationalist-conservative politics are paving the way for Leuchtenberg, or someone like him, to take power. ?] [? if chancellor == "Krymov" : However, Chairman Krymov's authoritarianism and scheming is paving the way for Leuchtenberg, or someone like him, to take power. ?][? if resist_coup == 1 and republic_victory == 0 and long_war == 0 and coup_victory == 0 : Given our defeat in the Petrograd coup, the far-right appears to be ascendant. ?][? if chancellor == "Shingarev" : However, Chancellor Shingarev's austerity policies and the continuation of the depression are paving the way for Leuchtenberg, or someone like him, to take power. ?]

[? if leuchtenberg_deported == 1 : We have arrested Leuchtenberg for inciting public violence, revolutionary activity, and for heading an illegal paramilitary. Hopefully the courts keep him locked away for a long time. ?]

@nts_win
view-if: chancellor == "Baidalakov" or president == "Baidalakov"
title: Despite the arrest of Leuchtenberg, the Solidarists have still taken power...
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Despite the arrest of Leuchtenberg, the NTS has somehow still wormed its way into power. [? if long_war == 1 : We are fighting them for control of Russia. ?]


@civil_war_won
title: We have won the civil war.
view-if: republic_victory == 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

We have won the civil war against the reactionary forces. Russia will be changed forever, but it is too early to know how.

@civil_war_lost
title: We lost the civil war.
view-if: total_defeat == 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

We have lost the civil war. At least it was a quick coup, and ended before Russia could be plunged into total war.

@long_war
title: Germany is gripped by civil war.
view-if: long_war == 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Russia has been stricken by a second civil war. While the first was short, fast, and bloody, there is no doubt that this one will be longer, harsh, and devestating. Countless lives have already been extinguished. The Solidarist, Tsarist, Communist, and Democratic forces clash in the streets and countryside. The landscape, urban and rural, will be scarred for a long time to come.

[? if is_favorable == 0 : The current conditions are not favorable for us. ?][? if west_relation >= 2: Our cause is popular in the West, but their sclerotic governments are reluctant to send us aid. ?][? if soviet_aid >= 1 : Communist parties abroad have sent aid to the Communists, but not the socialists and democrats, in an attempt to shape Russia's future government. ?][? if east_aid >= 1 : Poland, the Baltics, Ukraine, and Czechoslovakia have sent some assistance against the anti-democratic forces. ?]


@maisky_victorious
title: Ivan Maisky victorious
view-if: president == "Maisky"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Ivan Maisky has been elected as President of Russia. He had never desired to be the most powerful man in Russia, but now he is.

@president_nicolaevsky
title: Boris Nicolaevsky victorious
view-if: president == "Nicolaevsky"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Boris Nicolaevsky has been elected as President of Russia. As a young and ambitious RSDRP member, he will be shaping Russia for years to come.

@president_radchenko
title: Lyubov Radchenko is President
view-if: president == "Radchenko"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Lyubov Radchenko has been elected as President of Russia. She is the first woman to be elected as the head of state of any republic, and will contribute to shaping Russia for years to come.

@president_gorky
title: Maxim Gorky is President
view-if: president == "Gorky"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Maxim Gorky, possibly the most famous novelist in the nation, has been elected as President of Russia. As a Socialist and a pacifist, he is the repudiation of everything the Soldiarists stand for, and a symbol of a new Russian Republic that has moved beyond its checkered past.



@rsdrp_victorious
title: RSDRP still in government
view-if: rsdrp_in_government == 1 and chancellor_party == "RSDRP" and total_defeat == 0 and long_war == 0
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The RSDRP is still in government, under Chairman [+ chancellor +]. Given the circumstances, this is a substantial accomplishment.

@communist_victory
title: Communist victory
view-if: chancellor_party == "RKP" or president == "Kalinin" and total_defeat == 0 and long_war == 0
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The RKP has won power in Russia, with our assistance. They will try to remake Germany in Lenin's image. How much they succeed is yet to be determined.

@works_program
title: Works program enacted!
view-if: works_program > 0
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Our government has enacted a public works program!

@unemployment_reduced
title: Unemployment has been reduced from its peak.
view-if: unemployed <= 20 and unemployed >= 10 and year >= 1930
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

While still uncomfortably high, unemployment levels are nowhere near their peak. This is a success of our economic policy.

@unemployment_reduced_2
title: Unemployment has been successfully reduced!
view-if: unemployed < 10 and year >= 1930
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Unemployment levels have fallen substantially! This is a success of our economic policy.



@unemployment_high
title: Unemployment is still too high.
view-if: unemployed >= 20 and (chancellor != "Leuchtenberg" and president != "Leuchtenberg") and (total_defeat == 0) and long_war == 0
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Unemployment is still at dangerously high levels. Even though Leuchtenberg is not in power, the situation is ripe for instability and extremism.


@emergency_government
title: RSDRP ruling in an emergency government.
view-if: in_emergency_government == 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The RSDRP is ruling as part of an emergency minority government, led by President [+ president +] and Chairman [+ chancellor +]. This is a temporary and unstable arrangement, leaving the door open to further authoritarianism.

@peoples_party_achieved
title: The RSDRP is a "Mass Party".
view-if: peoples_party == 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The RSDRP has been declared a "Mass Party", representing all of the people, not just the working class. This policy has many supporters and detractors, and what will become of the party is still unclear.

@nationalization_achieved
title: Socialization of the economy has commenced.
view-if: nationalization_progress >= 2
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

As part of our socialist economic plan, we have nationalized a substantial portion of the economy, beginning the transition to actual socialism.

@works_councils
title: Works councils have more power.
view-if: works_councils >= 3
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Works councils now have substantially greater influence, giving workers democratic control over their economic lives.

@european_union
title: There is now a European Union!
view-if: eu = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

We have helped to form a European Union to bring peace and prosperity to the continent. Time will tell how effective it will be.

@achievements
title: Achievements
view-if: achievement_game_completed == 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu if started == 1; root.start_menu_2 if started == 0

